    "subject": "Mother sues OpenAI in US after daughter's death linked to ChatGPT use",
    "link": "https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/6/12/mother-sues-openai-in-us-after-daughters-death-linked-to-chatgpt-use?utm_source=bluesky&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=socialPulse",
