      "The Bright Side:\nPublic awareness of 'ghost networks' is the first step toward regulatory reform and holding insurance providers accountable.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThis is a failure of the WHAT plane. The service sold (mental health access) is not the service delivered (a list of unreachable providers).",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of Deception.\nWhen you map the gap between the promise of coverage and the reality of systemic denial...",
