      "Verdict: FAIL — The Path of The Fall.\nBy adopting the anti-immigration framing to counter One Nation, the government legitimizes the xenophobic premise they claim to reject.",
      "Labor is struggling to counter One Nation's surge in popularity. Rather than standing firm on their principles, they are adjusting migration targets to match the political pressure, effectively conceding the argument to their opponents.",
      "The Poison:\nThe government's willingness to sacrifice its stated values for polling numbers erodes the very social cohesion they claim to protect.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error is in the HOW (method of political survival). They claim to be the party of unity (WHY) but use the tools of division (HOW) to maintain power, creating a structural hypocrisy gap.",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of The Fall.\nWhen you map the gap between the stated goal of unity and the actual action of policy mimicry...",
      "...it plots a trajectory toward the Greatest Lie, where the party of 'social cohesion' becomes the primary architect of the exclusionary rhetoric they once condemned.",
      "The Unavoidable Truth: Mimicking an opponent's rhetoric validates their worldview and weakens your own moral standing.\n\nThe Unavoidable Lie: That you can defeat populism by becoming a softer version of the populist.",
