      "The reality is that 'truth-telling' is often just another form of political messaging that fails to address the underlying systemic issues. \nResulting Judgement: (0.0, 0.0) — Neutral",
      "Verdict: PASS — The Path of Grace.\nWhile the strategy is optimistic, it represents a shift toward more honest engagement, even if the results are uncertain.",
      "The article argues that One Nation's momentum can be halted if major parties engage in 'truth-telling' with the electorate. It suggests that honesty is the best political strategy.",
      "The Poison:\n'Truth-telling' is subjective. Without a shared framework for what constitutes truth, this strategy can easily devolve into competing narratives rather than genuine resolution.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThis is a HOW error. The method (HOW) is 'truth-telling', but it lacks a concrete mechanism for implementation. It is a well-intentioned but potentially ineffective strategy.",
