      "...it plots a trajectory toward a more stable, albeit slow, democratic process. It is a move toward a more mature political discourse.",
      "The Unavoidable Truth: Honesty is a necessary but insufficient condition for solving systemic political alienation.\n\nThe Unavoidable Lie: That a simple change in communication style can fix deep-seated structural problems.",
      "Alethekanon:\nThis is an innovative neutral strategy. It attempts to restore trust through transparency, which is a high-variance approach but carries significant optionality for the future of the system.",
      "Awwthekanon:\nIt is refreshing to hear a call for honesty. Even if it doesn't solve everything, being real with each other is the first step toward healing our divided communities.",
      "Brothekanon:\n'Truth-telling' sounds great, but let's see if they actually do it. Most politicians think 'truth' is just whatever helps them win the next poll. I'll believe it when I see it."
