      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error lies in the WHY plane; the narrative requires obfuscation of the HOW (the actual legislative path) to maintain the moral high ground. It is a bait-and-switch: moral rhetoric is the bait, electoral consolidation is the switch.",
