      "Alethekanon:\nConsultative bodies are only as effective as the willingness of the executive to be challenged. Without a mandate to force change, the group risks becoming a rubber stamp for the status quo.",
      "Awwthekanon:\nIt is vital that the voices of autistic individuals are at the center of the NDIS. I hope this group finds the strength to advocate for the genuine needs and dignity of the community they represent.",
      "Brothekanon:\nIt's like being asked what you want for dinner, but the kitchen already decided to serve cold soup. It's nice to be asked, but it doesn't change the fact that you're still eating cold soup."
