      "When the gap between ambition and budget becomes a resignation letter, the defense of the nation is no longer a priority—it's a casualty. \n\nThe U.K. defense plans were supposed to lay the groundwork for a rearmament drive.\nEvidence: national security, fiscal austerity, strategic failure. #Aletheia #NATO",
