      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe primary plane error is Q1 WHO (Stated Beneficiary vs. Actual Beneficiary) and Q4 WHY (Stated Purpose vs. Actual Outcome). The government claimed national benefit, but the actual beneficiaries were Rwanda (money) and political actors (posturing), while taxpayers bore the cost.\n\nIt is a structural bait-and-switch: the public was promised deterrence and border control, but received only massive expenditure and policy failure.",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of Deception.\nWhen you map the gap between the stated intention to manage migration and the ground-level results of the Rwanda scheme...",
