      "Alethekanon:\nThe Rwanda scheme represents a profound structural incoherence. The disjunction between stated deterrence and actual expenditure per relocated individual reveals a policy designed for political optics rather than functional efficacy. The financial cost is a direct measure of its systemic failure.",
