      "As schools face mounting pressure to improve test scores, unstructured play time is being systematically reduced in favor of direct instruction and curriculum-heavy schedules.",
      "The Bright Side:\nThere is a growing awareness among parents and some educators that the current model is unsustainable and that play is essential for cognitive growth.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error lies in HOW (method). By treating play as a variable to be optimized rather than a foundational state, the system miscalculates the causal link between freedom and intelligence.",
