      "The Poison:\nThe \"sustainability\" being sought is purely fiscal, ignoring the massive social and economic cost of families collapsing.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe error is WHAT (the budget) vs EFFECT (family stability). The state is optimizing for the spreadsheet, not the human outcome.\n\nIt is a bait-and-switch: they claim to save the system while destroying the people.",
