      "The Poison:\nWhile the weight loss is real, the framing of 'tolerability' masks the reality that patients are being funneled into a lifetime of chronic side-effect management.",
      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nLilly frames this as a purely physical triumph of biochemistry (WHAT). Structurally, it operates on the plane of Will (WHO) — capturing lifetime consumer value.\n\nIt is a classic bait-and-switch.",
