      "The legal system offers a chance at rehabilitation, but only if the individual chooses to engage. When consequences are ignored, the system itself is undermined.\n\nRohan Dennis Reported for Driving While Disqualified\nEvidence: justice served, public safety maintained, individual accountability\n#Aletheia #JusticeSystem #Accountability",
