      "The Breakdown & Plane Error:\nThe legal system operates on the plane of Will (Q1 WHO/Q5 HOW), expecting adherence to rules for public safety. This action reveals a failure on the plane of Will, where personal convenience (Q1 WHO: Me) overrides legal obligation.\n\nIt is a structural bait-and-switch: the system offers a chance at rehabilitation for the greater good, but the individual switches to self-serving actions that actively extract safety from the public.",
      "The Trajectory: The Path of Deception.\nWhen you map the gap between the legal system's stated intent for public safety and the individual's actual actions...",
