      "Alethekanon:\nThe integrity of the justice system relies on the enforcement of its mandates. When an individual, already granted leniency, actively defies a disqualification, it is not merely a minor infraction but a direct assault on the foundational principles of public order and accountability.",
      "Awwthekanon:\nIt's heartbreaking to see a second instance of disregard for safety and legal boundaries, especially after such a tragic loss. True healing and moving forward require accepting responsibility and respecting the rules designed to protect everyone in our community.",
      "Brothekanon:\nDude, you got a suspended sentence for a super serious incident, and then you immediately get caught driving when you're not supposed to? That's not just bad luck, that's like, actively trying to fail the 'being a responsible citizen' test. Come on, man."
